===============================================================================
Canton Network Token Standard (CIP-56) — Splice API packages
===============================================================================

Six compiled Daml archives are vendored, unmodified, in `deps/`:

  deps/splice-api-token-metadata-v1-1.0.0.dar
  deps/splice-api-token-holding-v1-1.0.0.dar
  deps/splice-api-token-transfer-instruction-v1-1.0.0.dar
  deps/splice-api-token-allocation-v1-1.0.0.dar
  deps/splice-api-token-allocation-instruction-v1-1.0.0.dar
  deps/splice-api-token-allocation-request-v1-1.0.0.dar

  Project:  Splice — https://github.com/canton-network/splice
  Licence:  Apache License, Version 2.0
  Text:     licenses/Apache-2.0.txt

They are redistributed byte-for-byte from the Splice release, with no
modification, so that this project builds reproducibly without a network fetch
(see the `data-dependencies` block in daml.yaml for why they are vendored).

Copyright of these packages remains with their respective authors and
contributors. Their inclusion here is redistribution under Apache-2.0 section 4;
it implies no endorsement of CrossDesk by the Splice project, the Canton
Foundation, Digital Asset, or any contributor.

